  "description_zh": "纳尔逊·曼德拉 (1918-2013) 南非首位黑人总统 (1994-1999)，反种族隔离斗争象征，罗本岛囚徒 27 年，主持真相与和解委员会 (TRC) 愈合民族创伤，构建彩虹国家愿景，诺贝尔和平奖得主，道德权威超越政治。",
  "description_en": "Nelson Mandela (1918-2013) South Africa first Black President (1994-1999), anti-apartheid struggle symbol, Robben Island prisoner 27 years, chaired Truth and Reconciliation Commission (TRC) healing national wounds, built Rainbow Nation vision, Nobel Peace Prize laureate, moral authority transcending politics.",
  "reason_zh": "曼德拉代表和解政治如何通过道德权威超越报复循环，展示了真相委员会如何在后冲突社会实现愈合，其彩虹国家愿景成为全球转型正义的范式标杆。",
  "reason_en": "Mandela represents how reconciliation politics transcends retribution cycles through moral authority, demonstrating how truth commissions achieve healing in post-conflict societies, his Rainbow Nation vision becoming global transitional justice paradigm benchmark.",
